    <string name="how_accurate">How accurate is this?</string>
    <string name="accuracy_body">In Demo mode you see real CSH-AQI forecasts. On the 2026 summer test they missed the true AQI by 0.65 points on average 1 hour ahead, 3.2 points 6 hours ahead, 5.3 points 12 hours ahead and 9.0 points 24 hours ahead. Simply repeating the current AQI missed by 1.09, 4.84, 7.13 and 9.59 points.</string>
    <string name="accuracy_live">Live forecasts use the newest station reading plus the CAMS model trend. When station data is older than a day, the AQI is estimated from the CAMS model and is less accurate.</string>
