    <string name="about">About AirSathi</string>
    <string name="about_body">AirSathi forecasts India\'s official CPCB Air Quality Index for 8 KSPCB stations in Karnataka with the CSH-AQI model, and turns it into advice from CPCB, MoHFW (NCDC) and WHO. Station data: KSPCB via OpenAQ (CC BY 4.0). Model data: CAMS via Open-Meteo. Student major project.</string>
    <string name="privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Your e-mail, family profiles and diary are stored only to give you advice and alerts. They are never sold or shared. You can delete everything at any time (Me → Delete my account).</string>
